WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.338
[hopeful mumbling]

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:08.508
The fantasy cast lists have been posted.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.219
Wow, so I guess I’m WR1 on the first team?

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:12.721
Oh, I'm gonna break some legs.

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.973
CMC’s the lead on the third best team?

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:16.725
But what if he get hurt?

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:17.976
That's how you all sound.

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:20.061
A freshman got a better part than me?

00:00:20.603 --> 00:00:22.647
Wow. Can’t wait to see my name in lights!

00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:24.190
BIJAN ROBINSON!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.234
Say mister, do you know where I can find the big time?

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.360
Listen, kid.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.279
They call it fantasy for a reason.

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:35.452
W-wait, I’m sorry. I’m Brandon Aiyuk’s understudy?

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.829
Don't be mad. But I got to miss, like,
the first couple of shows.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:41.041
The young backs only got cast ahead of us because they’re cheap.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.584
JT, it's not fair.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:43.668
He's on vocal rest.

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:45.670
UGH..... receivers.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.506
How now AJ Brown cow?

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:52.844
CeeDee Lamb got in a knee deep jam on a needy scam.

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:55.472
Calvin, you're a high upside Receiver 2! Congrats!

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:57.223
Bet! I mean NOT BET.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.683
Let’s see...

00:00:58.683 --> 00:00:59.434
Hey! There I am!

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:01.269
I barely even auditioned!

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:02.729
Maybe I should transfer.

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:06.066
Got another show! This is by the guy who always drafts a QB too early.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.484
Wow, I'm the lead!

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:10.904
And my supporting cast is... two kickers?

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.447
Can they catch?

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:15.867
This show was cast by someone who hasn't
been following football in a few years.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:16.993
Yes!

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:20.914
And this last one is selected by someone who thinks they are a fantasy genius.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:22.540
Who's Sam LaPorta?

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.666
-Um, you are.
-Oh!

00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:25.210
Time for the first rehearsal!

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.711
I hope everyone’s patient with me!

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:29.881
Uh, uh... LINE?

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:32.467
COME ON, THIS IS WHY YOU GOTTA COME TO REHEARSAL.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.010
You should have f--ing picked me.

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:41.684
Hill Thrills Due Tua a Killer Script and Natural Talent!

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:47.107
BEARS REFUSE TO PERFORM, JORDAN LOVE PUTS ON A SHOW FOR CHICAGO FANS

00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:50.944
AND HOLY S---, THE GIANTS LOOK F--ING ROUGH

